## STEP 2 — NativeWind → Unistyles v3 conversion rules

This project uses `react-native-unistyles` v3. The fetched source will use NativeWind (`className`, `cn()`, `cva`). Convert as follows:

### Imports

```diff
- import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';
- import { cva, type VariantProps } from 'class-variance-authority';
+ import { StyleSheet } from 'react-native-unistyles';
```

### Remove className props

```diff
- function Checkbox({ className, checkedClassName, ...props }) {
+ function Checkbox({ style, ...props }) {
```

### Convert className → StyleSheet

```diff
- <CheckboxPrimitive.Root
-   className={cn('size-4 border rounded-sm', props.checked && 'bg-primary')}
- />
+ <CheckboxPrimitive.Root
+   style={[styles.root, style]}
+ />

+ const styles = StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({
+   root: {
+     width: 16,
+     height: 16,
+     borderWidth: 1,
+     borderRadius: theme.radius.sm,
+     borderColor: theme.colors.border,
+   },
+ }));
```

### Convert cva variants

```diff
- const buttonVariants = cva('...base...', {
-   variants: {
-     variant: { default: 'bg-primary', destructive: 'bg-destructive' },
-     size: { sm: 'h-8 px-3', default: 'h-10 px-4' },
-   },
-   defaultVariants: { variant: 'default', size: 'default' },
- });
```

Becomes Unistyles variants:

```ts
const styles = StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({
  root: {
    flexDirection: 'row',
    alignItems: 'center',
    justifyContent: 'center',
    borderRadius: theme.radius.md,
    variants: {
      variant: {
        default: { backgroundColor: theme.colors.primary },
        destructive: { backgroundColor: theme.colors.destructive },
        ghost: { backgroundColor: 'transparent' },
      },
      size: {
        sm: { height: 32, paddingHorizontal: 12 },
        default: { height: 40, paddingHorizontal: 16 },
        lg: { height: 44, paddingHorizontal: 24 },
      },
    },
  },
}));
```

And activate variants in the component:

```ts
styles.useVariants({ variant, size });
```

### Convert dark mode tokens

NativeWind uses `dark:bg-xxx`. In Unistyles, theming is handled automatically — use the theme callback:

| NativeWind class | Unistyles equivalent |
|---|---|
| `bg-primary` | `theme.colors.primary` |
| `bg-background` | `theme.colors.background` |
| `text-foreground` | `theme.colors.foreground` |
| `border-input` | `theme.colors.border` |
| `text-muted-foreground` | `theme.colors.mutedForeground` |
| `rounded-md` | `theme.radius.md` |
| `p-4` | `theme.spacing[4]` |
| `dark:bg-xxx` | handled by the dark theme automatically |

### Keep these as-is

- `@rn-primitives/*` imports (install the package)
- `lucide-react-native` icons (if already in project deps, else ask user)
- `Platform.select()` logic
- `hitSlop` values
- `React.forwardRef` pattern
- `displayName`

