## STEP 3 — File placement and code rules

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Adapted primitive from rnr | `src/ui/primitives/<name>.tsx` |
| App-level composition | `src/ui/components/<ComponentName>/index.tsx` |
| Export from barrel | `src/ui/components/index.ts` or `src/ui/primitives/index.ts` |

**Code rules:**
- `StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({ ... }))` at the BOTTOM of the file
- Always `[styles.root, style]` to allow external overrides
- No `StyleSheet` from `react-native`, no inline styles
- Always `React.forwardRef` for components that wrap primitives
- Always set `displayName`

---

## Minimum packages to install

Only install what the specific component actually imports:

```bash
# The primitive package the component uses
yarn add @rn-primitives/<name>

# Shared utilities — install once if not yet in project
yarn add @rn-primitives/types
```

Do NOT install `nativewind`, `class-variance-authority`, or `tailwind-merge` — those are replaced by Unistyles.

