label          menubar        popover        progress       radio-group
select         separator      skeleton       switch         tabs
text           textarea       toggle         toggle-group   tooltip
```

---

## How the user requests a component

Examples of good prompts:

> "Add a Switch component. Check primitives folder first. If not there, fetch from reactnativereusables, adapt to Unistyles, install minimum deps."

> "Build a Button with variants: default, destructive, outline, ghost. Here is the design: [image]. Ask me anything unclear."

> "Add a Select dropdown. Fetch the latest source from rnr, convert className to Unistyles. Only install what's needed."

The AI must follow STEP 1 → STEP 2 → STEP 3 in that order every time.
